Project: Master-Slave Database System

User Stories:

1. As a developer, I want to save user data into the master database so that data consistency is maintained.

2. As a system, I want to read user data from the slave database so that read operations are faster.

3. As a developer, I want to route database operations dynamically so that read and write operations are separated.

4. As a user, I want to retrieve all users so that I can view stored data.

5. As a user, I want to delete a user so that unwanted data can be removed.

6. As a system, I want to ensure data validation so that invalid inputs are not stored.